      `the data collected is no longer needed for the purpose for which it was obtained` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 78(2) second sentence the authority must delete the data collected as soon as it is no longer needed for the purpose for which it was obtained` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 78 the group of Article 78 applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
